# The basis library, one file per line, in load order:
#
#   file | always or demand | host | provides | requires
#
# always    the file is compiled before every program
# demand    it is compiled before the programs that mention a name it
#           provides, and before the files that require it
# host      how tests/basis/host/gen-host-basis.sh gives the file to MLton,
#           SML/NJ and Poly/ML: yes (as it is), swap (without the types and
#           exceptions a host must keep its own of) or no
# provides  the structures, signatures, functors and top-level types the
#           file declares
# requires  those of other files that it names; each must be provided by an
#           earlier line. -Name: the file has the identifier Name without
#           needing the file that provides it (initial.sml declares the
#           exception Option, pervasive.sml raises it and defines the
#           function substring, which is also the name of a type).
#
# `rune --basis-check` verifies the last two columns against the sources, and
# that a demand file declares modules and types only: everything it puts in
# scope is in its provides column, so a program that mentions it loads the
# file. (A top-level value or fixity directive belongs in an always file.) `rune --basis-deps FILE...` prints the files a program loads, and
# `rune --basis all` loads every file.
initial.sml     | always | swap |                       | -Option
pervasive.sml   | always | yes  |                       | -Option -substring
general.sml     | demand | yes  | General               |
stringcvt.sml   | demand | yes  | StringCvt             |
bool.sml        | demand | yes  | Bool                  | StringCvt
option.sml      | demand | yes  | Option                |
list.sml        | demand | yes  | List                  |
listpair.sml    | demand | yes  | ListPair              |
intinf.sml      | demand | yes  | IntInf LargeInt RuneIntInf | List StringCvt
int.sml         | demand | yes  | Int                   | IntInf StringCvt
word.sml        | demand | yes  | Word LargeWord        | Int IntInf List StringCvt
word_sig.sml    | demand | yes  | WORD                  | LargeInt LargeWord StringCvt Word
word8.sml       | demand | yes  | Word8                 | StringCvt WORD Word
char.sml        | demand | yes  | RuneEscape Char       | Int StringCvt
string.sml      | demand | yes  | String                | Char Int List RuneEscape StringCvt -substring
substring.sml   | demand | yes  | Substring substring   | List String
ieeereal.sml    | demand | yes  | IEEEReal              | StringCvt
real.sml        | demand | yes  | Real Math LargeReal   | IEEEReal Int IntInf List StringCvt
vector.sml      | demand | yes  | Vector                | List Option
array.sml       | demand | yes  | Array                 | List Option Vector
os.sml          | demand | yes  | OS                    |
io.sml          | demand | yes  | IO                    |
textio.sml      | demand | yes  | TextIO                | IO OS String Substring
binio.sml       | demand | yes  | Word8Vector Byte BinIO | String TextIO
commandline.sml | demand | yes  | CommandLine           |
